---
{
  title: "percent"
}
---
### NAME

    percent() - Calculates what percentage `a` is of `b`.

### SYNOPSIS

    float percent( float a, float b );

### DESCRIPTION

    Calculates what percentage `a` is of `b`.

### PARAMETERS

    a  (float)
       The part value.

    b  (float)
       The whole value.

### RETURN VALUES

    (float) The percentage of `a` out of `b`.
